## API Change: /auth/login Response

The `/auth/login` API endpoint now returns user data along with the JWT in the successful login response (200 OK).

**Previous Response:**

```json
{
  "token": "your_jwt_token"
}
```

**New Response:**

```json
{
  "token": "your_jwt_token",
  "user": {
    "id": "user_id",
    "name": "user_name",
    "email": "user_email"
  }
}
```

This change allows the frontend to directly access user information upon successful login without needing a separate API call to fetch user details.



